  "hints": [
    "Write 27 as a power of 3, then set the exponents equal."
  ],
  "solution": [
    "$27 = 3^3$, so $3^{2x-1} = 3^3$.",
    "Equal bases mean equal exponents: $2x - 1 = 3$, so $x = 2$."
  ],
